    "created_at": "2025-11-13T05:58:14Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-11-13T05:58:14Z",
    "body": "> [@emilio](https://github.com/emilio) made me realize a related issue, which is that logical values are relative to something. And what they are relative to here would be CSS as writing-mode isn't in HTML.\n\nWhile `writing-mode` can be set explicitly in CSS, `lang` and `dir` also affect it.",
